// 用例目的：参数 protectionLegReferencePrice 传入负值 —— 实测包装器宽松接受，记录实际行为
@testing:case="buildCreditDefaultSwap accepts negative protectionLegReferencePrice (no validation)"
rCdsR3RpN = caplib::buildCreditDefaultSwap(1000000.0, currency, 2019.06.20, 2024.06.20, "PAY", "CASH", -1.0, 1.0, "SENIOR", 0.4, 0.01, "FLAT_SPREAD", "ACT_360", "QUARTERLY", "MODIFIED_FOLLOWING", "CAL_CFETS", 0.01, 0, "TF_CDS_NAME", "TF_CDS_R3_RPN", false)
